:"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Location: Azizi Ruby is located in the heart of Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC), offering easy access to major highways like Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Al Khail Road, ensuring seamless connectivity to key areas of Dubai.</li><li>Luxury Amenities: The development features a range of top-tier amenities, including a swimming pool, fully equipped gym, kids’ play area, cinema, and clubhouse, providing a balanced and comfortable living experience for residents.</li><li>Variety of Floor Plans: Azizi Ruby offers a range of spacious floor plans, including studios and 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, catering to different lifestyle needs and preferences.</li><li>Flexible Payment Plan: With a 50/50 payment plan and a handover expected in 2026, Azizi Ruby provides an attractive investment opportunity for buyers seeking modern, affordable luxury in Dubai.</li><li>Family-Friendly Community: Known for its active lifestyle and family-oriented atmosphere, JVC is an ideal location for families and professionals, offering ample green spaces and essential amenities right at your doorstep.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1221,"cta":{"id":1987,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/map_fed4953a93.jpg","hash":"map_fed4953a93","name":"Azizi Ruby by Azizi Developments"},"style":null,"title":"Luxury Living with stunning views —Experience the best from Azizi RUBY.","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Azizi Ruby at JVC is ideally located in the heart of Jumeirah Village Circle, a vibrant community known for its active lifestyle and family-friendly atmosphere. The Azizi Ruby location offers easy access to major highways like Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Roa